:"]}," If you have ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Legacy Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Legacy_Destiny"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," to automatically treat your next ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check as though you had rolled a 20 on the check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
